cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Universal Threshold Field Initiative"
abstract: >-
  The Universal Threshold Field (UTF) programme braids astrophysical, biological,
  cognitive, climatic, and synthetic intelligence data into a shared logistic
  resonance. Every contribution foregrounds the quartet (R, Θ, β, ζ(R)) and the
  switch-like response σ(β(R-Θ)) that drives emergent order beyond critical
  thresholds. Version 5.0.0 turns the repository into a fractal governance
  skeleton (`setup/AGENTS_BOOTSTRAP.md`, `setup/THEORY_OF_STRUCTURE.md`,
  `setup/universal_skeleton_builder.py`), adds structural isomorphism models
  (`models/cosmic_alpha_phi.py`, `models/social_rigidity_ising.py`), and ships a
  Zenodo-ready release bundle to keep DOI and GitHub assets in lockstep.
authors:
  - family-names: "Römer"
    given-names: "Johann"
  - name: "Universal Threshold Field Contributors"
version: 5.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17472834
date-released: 2025-11-22
